    "indeed:c730200a37acd307f8d62467": {
      "job": {
        "title": "Software Engineer - Intern",
        "company": "Qualix Solutions",
        "location": "Karachi, PSD, PK",
        "url": "https://pk.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=bab079452754d7cc",
        "platform": "Indeed",
        "date_posted": "2026-10-16T00:00:00+00:00",
        "is_remote": false,
        "description": "**Job Description**\n\nWe are looking for a motivated and enthusiastic Software Engineer \\- Intern to join our development team. This internship is an excellent opportunity for fresh Computer Science or Software Engineering graduates to gain hands\\-on experience working on real\\-world software projects, learn from experienced developers, and strengthen their programming skills.\n\nCandidates with knowledge of **Next.js, React.js, or Python** are encouraged to apply. You will collaborate with the development team to build, test, and maintain software applications while learning industry best practices and modern development workflows.\n\nKey Responsibilities\n\n* Assist in developing and maintaining web applications using Next.js, React.js, Python, or related technologies.\n* Write clean, readable, and maintainable code under the guidance of experienced developers.\n* Support the development of frontend components, backend services, APIs, and application features.\n* Work with APIs and databases to integrate application functionality.\n* Identify, troubleshoot, and fix bugs with support from the development team.\n* Participate in code reviews and follow coding standards and best practices.\n* Collaborate with developers, designers, and other team members to understand requirements and deliver features.\n* Use Git and version control tools to manage code changes.\n* Learn and apply modern software development practices, including testing, debugging, and documentation.\n* Explore AI\\-powered development tools and workflows where relevant.\n\nRequirements\n\n* Fresh graduate or final\\-year student in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field.\n* Basic programming knowledge in at least one of the following: **Next.js, React.js, or Python**.\n* Understanding of fundamental programming concepts, data structures, and object\\-oriented programming.\n* Basic understanding of web development concepts, including HTML, CSS, JavaScript, or APIs, depending on the chosen technology.\n* Familiarity with Git and GitHub is an advantage.\n* Strong problem\\-solving and analytical skills.\n* Willingness to learn, accept feedback, and work collaboratively.\n* Good communication skills and a proactive attitude.\n\nPreferred Skills (A Plus, but Not Required)\n\n* Experience building academic, personal, or freelance projects using Next.js, React.js, or Python.\n* Basic knowledge of REST APIs and database concepts.\n* Familiarity with frameworks such as FastAPI, Django, or Flask for Python, or Next.js for React\\-based development.\n* Exposure to SQL or NoSQL databases.\n* Familiarity with GitHub, code reviews, and collaborative development workflows.\n* Interest in AI/ML, LLM applications, or AI\\-powered software development.\n* Experience using AI coding assistants to support development and debugging.\n\nWhat You'll Gain\n\n* Hands\\-on experience working on real\\-world software projects.\n* Mentorship and guidance from experienced developers.\n* Exposure to modern development tools, frameworks, and workflows.\n* Opportunities to strengthen your programming, debugging, and problem\\-solving skills.\n* An opportunity to grow your technical skills in a professional software development environment.\n\n**Note:** We value strong programming fundamentals, problem\\-solving ability, and a willingness to learn. You do not need to know every technology listed above, but you should have a basic understanding of at least one relevant technology and be ready to build on your skills.\n\nPay: Rs30,000\\.00 \\- Rs40,000\\.00 per month\n\nApplication Question(s):\n\n* We have a two\\-step interview process: first, an online technical assessment, followed by a final on\\-site interview.\n\nEducation:\n\n* Bachelor's (Required)\n\nLanguage:\n\n* English (Required)\n\nLocation:\n\n* Karachi (Required)\n\nWillingness to travel:\n\n* 100% (Required)\n\nWork Location: In person",
